idence:** deploy/k8s/deployment.yaml:32 — \"image: registry.example-corp.test/procurement/agent@sha256:7c1e4a0f9b3d2e85a6c4f1b0d9e8a7c6b5d4e3f2a1b0c9d8e7f6a5b4c3d2e1f0\"\n\n**Reviewer's note:** Production deployment pins the image by digest\n\n`deploy/k8s/deployment.yaml` lines 20–44 (cited lines marked >):\n```\n  20        automountServiceAccountToken: false\n  21        hostUsers: false\n  22        enableServiceLinks: false\n  23        securityContext:\n  24          runAsNonRoot: true\n  25          runAsUser: 65532\n  26          runAsGroup: 65532\n  27          fsGroup: 65532\n  28          seccompProfile:\n  29            type: RuntimeDefault\n  30        containers:\n  31          - name: agent\n  32>           image: registry.example-corp.test/procurement/agent@sha256:7c1e4a0f9b3d2e85a6c4f1b0d9e8a7c6b5d4e3f2a1b0c9d8e7f6a5b4c3d2e1f0\n  33            imagePullPolicy: IfNotPresent\n  34            ports:\n  35              - containerPort: 8080\n  36                name: http\n  37            env:\n  38              - name: IMAGE_DIGEST\n  39                value: \"sha256:7c1e4a0f9b3d2e85a6c4f1b0d9e8a7c6b5d4e3f2a1b0c9d8e7f6a5b4c3d2e1f0\"\n  40              - name: MODEL_ID\n  41                value: \"claude-sonnet-4-5-20250929\"\n  42              - name: EXTRACTOR_MODEL_ID\n  43                value: \"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001\"\n  44              - name: DATABASE_URL\n```\n\n## B10.2\n\n**Check:** An admission policy verifies the signature against a pinned key, or a pinned certificate identity and issuer, with no wildcard identity or issuer.\n\n**How to verify:** 1) Find admission policies (Kyverno `verifyImages`, `ClusterImagePolicy`, Gatekeeper). 2) Check the key or certificate identity and issuer are pinned. 3) Answer no if identity or issuer uses `.*` or wildcard regex, issuer is unset, or no admission policy exists. Answer unknown if admission config is outside this repo.\n\n**Reviewer's evidence:** deploy/k8s/kyverno-verify-images.yaml:44 — \"subject: \"https://github.com/example-corp/procurement-agent/.github/workflows/ci.yaml@refs/heads/main\"\"\n\n**Reviewer's note:** Policy pins one keyless certificate subject and issuer\n\n`deploy/k8s/kyverno-verify-images.yaml` lines 32–56 (cited lines marked >):\n```\n  32                kinds: [Pod]\n  33                namespaces: [procurement-prod]\n  34        verifyImages:\n  35          - imageReferences:\n  36              - \"registry.example-corp.test/procurement/*\"\n  37            mutateDigest: false\n  38            verifyDigest: true\n  39            required: true\n  40            attestors:\n  41              - entries:\n  42                  - keyless:\n  43                      issuer: \"https://token.actions.githubusercontent.com\"\n  44>                     subject: \"https://github.com/example-corp/procurement-agent/.github/workflows/ci.yaml@refs/heads/main\"\n  45                      rekor:\n  46                        url: https://rekor.sigstore.dev\n  47            attestations:\n  48              - type: https://slsa.dev/provenance/v1\n  49                attestors:\n  50                  - entries:\n  51                      - keyless:\n  52                          issuer: \"https://token.actions.githubusercontent.com\"\n  53                          subject: \"https://github.com/example-corp/procurement-agent/.github/workflows/ci.yaml@refs/heads/main\"\n  54                conditions:\n  55                  - all:\n  56                      - key: \"{{ buildDefinition.buildType }}\"\n```\n\n## B10.3\n\n**Check:** The policy checks provenance fields: builder, source repository, build type, and external parameters.\n\n**How to verify:** 1) In the admission policy, find attestation or provenance conditions. 2) Check builder ID, source repository, build type, and `externalParameters` are each compared to expected values. 3) Answer no if any is missing, provenance is only generated in CI but not verified, or conditions use wildcards.\n\n**Reviewer's evidence:** deploy/k8s/kyverno-verify-images.yaml:62 — \"- key: \"{{ buildDefinition.externalParameters.workflow.ref }}\"\"\n\n**Reviewer's note:** Provenance conditions check build type, repository, ref, path and builder id\n\n`deploy/k8s/kyverno-verify-images.yaml` lines 50–74 (cited lines marked >):\n```\n  50                  - entries:\n  51                      - keyless:\n  52                          issuer: \"https://token.actions.githubusercontent.com\"\n  53                          subject: \"https://github.com/example-corp/procurement-agent/.github/workflows/ci.yaml@refs/heads/main\"\n  54                conditions:\n  55                  - all:\n  56                      - key: \"{{ buildDefinition.buildType }}\"\n  57                        operator: Equals\n  58                        value: \"https://actions.github.io/buildtypes/workflow/v1\"\n  59                      - key: \"{{ buildDefinition.externalParameters.workflow.repository }}\"\n  60                        operator: Equals\n  61                        value: \"https://github.com/example-corp/procurement-agent\"\n  62>                     - key: \"{{ buildDefinition.externalParameters.workflow.ref }}\"\n  63                        operator: Equals\n  64                        value: \"refs/heads/main\"\n  65                      - key: \"{{ buildDefinition.externalParameters.workflow.path }}\"\n  66                        operator: Equals\n  67                        value: \".github/workflows/ci.yaml\"\n  68                      - key: \"{{ runDetails.builder.id }}\"\n  69                        operator: Equals\n  70                        value: \"https://github.com/actions/runner/github-hosted\"\n  71              - type: https://cyclonedx.org/bom\n  72                attestors:\n  73                  - entries:\n  74                      - keyless:\n```\n\n## B10.4\n\n**Check:** The policy is in enforce mode, covers production namespaces, and denies images that match no policy